# A BACKUP OF A CREDENTIALS FILE IS STILL A CREDENTIALS FILE (added 2026-09-02).
# `docs/Credentials.txt` was already ignored above, but the 2026-08-29 key rotation left a
# dated .bak copy of it untracked in the working tree and matched by nothing here - one
# careless `git add -A` from being committed. Patterned rather than named, so the next
# rotation's backup is covered without anyone having to remember.
docs/Credentials.txt*
**/Credentials.txt*
**/credentials.txt*
